							I was in a bit of a mood...<br /><br />Really it was more of a general impression I was getting from a few people that was bothering me rather than your and Matteo&#039;s posts specifically or anything like that. Instead of commenting generally, I took it personally and if I read something into your posts that was not there, I apologize. I said some things I shouldn&#039;t have.
